# 🌐 Social Media Platform

A responsive Social Media Platform developed using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Node.js, and Express.js. This project was created as part of the **CodeAlpha Web Development Internship**. It allows users to create posts, like posts, comment, edit, and delete posts while demonstrating frontend and backend integration.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🏠 Responsive Home Page
- 👤 User Profile Section
- 🔐 Login Page
- 📝 Registration Page
- ✍️ Create New Post
- ❤️ Like Posts
- 💬 Comment on Posts
- ✏️ Edit Posts
- 🗑️ Delete Posts
- 🌐 Express.js Backend
- 🔗 Frontend and Backend Integration
- 📡 REST API for Posts
- 🎨 Clean and Modern UI

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

### Frontend
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (ES6)

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js
- CORS

